  "shortName": null,
  "description": "Great Lakes Fur Con (GLFC) was an annual furry convention in Grand Rapids, Michigan, held from 2014 to 2016. It began when Lamper announced at a local bowling meet in December 2012 that he wanted to start a furry convention in Grand Rapids, and he was joined by Palasm, Kira Tora, Inola and Shooter Fox. The first was held February 7 to 9, 2014, at the Ramada Plaza, and later editions at the Holiday Inn Express South, supporting Crash's Landing and Big Sid's Sanctuary. A 2017 edition was planned but not held.",
